{"id": "en_thin_ice_p2", "total": 72.79, "segments": [{"text": "Part two. A massive pack of hungry wolves emerges from the dark forest trees and stares directly at him.", "start": 0.0, "end": 5.38}, {"text": "Ethan freezes instantly because running triggers the predatory chase instinct in every single wild animal.", "start": 6.0, "end": 10.26}, {"text": "He remembers he has roughly 10 minutes of useful movement left before hypothermia slows his freezing muscles.", "start": 10.84, "end": 15.04}, {"text": "Ethan slowly backs away toward the protective shelter of the thick tree line without making sudden frantic motions.", "start": 15.78, "end": 20.42}, {"text": "One. He keeps his eyes locked directly on the alpha wolf to show strength and avoid looking like prey.", "start": 21.0, "end": 25.16}, {"text": "Two. Ethan reaches behind his heavy winter jacket and pulls out a small metal emergency whistle from his pocket.", "start": 25.82, "end": 30.82}, {"text": "Three. He blows three loud piercing blasts into the freezing air to scare the wild pack away immediately.", "start": 31.42, "end": 36.42}, {"text": "The sharp metallic sound echoes across the frozen lake and startles the lead wolves standing on the snow.", "start": 37.04, "end": 40.98}, {"text": "Ethan continues to back away toward the tall evergreens while the hesitating pack slowly turns back into the dark woods.", "start": 41.76, "end": 46.74}, {"text": "He finally reaches the safety of the dense forest and climbs up onto a high rocky ledge to stay protected.", "start": 47.3, "end": 51.4}, {"text": "Ethan survived the deadly freezing water and escaped the hungry wolves by using calm and calculated survival choices.", "start": 52.04, "end": 56.88}, {"text": "He builds a small warming fire and waits safely for help to arrive before darkness falls across the winter landscape.", "start": 57.36, "end": 62.08}, {"text": "Always stay calm when facing wild animals and dangerous freezing water because panic is your absolute worst enemy.", "start": 62.64, "end": 67.92}, {"text": "Follow for a new scenario tomorrow.", "start": 68.48, "end": 69.64}], "words": [["Part", 0.0, 0.3], ["two.", 0.237, 0.474], ["A", 1.12, 1.24], ["massive", 1.24, 1.5], ["pack", 1.5, 1.72], ["of", 1.72, 1.98], ["hungry", 1.98, 2.2], ["wolves", 2.2, 2.46], ["emerges", 2.46, 2.84], ["from", 2.84, 3.1], ["the", 3.1, 3.2], ["dark", 3.2, 3.38], ["forest", 3.38, 3.66], ["trees", 3.66, 3.96], ["and", 3.96, 4.42], ["stares", 4.42, 4.66], ["directly", 4.66, 4.92], ["at", 4.92, 5.22], ["him.", 5.22, 5.38], ["Ethan", 6.0, 6.14], ["freezes", 6.14, 6.5], ["instantly", 6.5, 6.94], ["because", 6.94, 7.26], ["running", 7.26, 7.56], ["triggers", 7.56, 7.82], ["the", 7.82, 7.98], ["predatory", 7.98, 8.32], ["chase", 8.32, 8.6], ["instinct", 8.6, 8.98], ["in", 8.98, 9.16], ["every", 9.16, 9.46], ["single", 9.46, 9.72], ["wild", 9.72, 9.94], ["animal.", 9.94, 10.26], ["He", 10.84, 11.0], ["remembers", 11.0, 11.2], ["he", 11.2, 11.4], ["has", 11.4, 11.48], ["roughly", 11.48, 11.64], ["10", 11.64, 11.98], ["minutes", 11.98, 12.18], ["of", 12.18, 12.36], ["useful", 12.36, 12.56], ["movement", 12.56, 12.84], ["left", 12.84, 13.08], ["before", 13.08, 13.5], ["hypothermia", 13.5, 14.02], ["slows", 14.02, 14.3], ["his", 14.3, 14.56], ["freezing", 14.56, 14.8], ["muscles.", 14.8, 15.04], ["Ethan", 15.78, 15.9], ["slowly", 15.9, 16.26], ["backs", 16.26, 16.56], ["away", 16.56, 16.8], ["toward", 16.8, 17.04], ["the", 17.04, 17.16], ["protective", 17.16, 17.4], ["shelter", 17.4, 17.72], ["of", 17.72, 17.94], ["the", 17.94, 18.04], ["thick", 18.04, 18.18], ["tree", 18.18, 18.38], ["line", 18.38, 18.58], ["without", 18.58, 18.98], ["making", 18.98, 19.24], ["sudden", 19.24, 19.58], ["frantic", 19.9, 20.1], ["motions.", 20.1, 20.42], ["One.", 21.0, 21.26], ["He", 21.74, 21.88], ["keeps", 21.88, 22.02], ["his", 22.02, 22.16], ["eyes", 22.16, 22.22], ["locked", 22.22, 22.42], ["directly", 22.42, 22.84], ["on", 22.84, 23.06], ["the", 23.06, 23.1